      "en": "Joseph fell on his father’s face, wept on him, and kissed him.",
      "ko": "요셉이 아비 얼굴에 구푸려 울며 입맞추고",
      "source_text_hash": "b777b6db4cdfd4dfae675f0cefd3bf3415582f21c607c04fedb4a808c5f5ae18",
      "translation_text_hash": "a91e16d0c3bb7dd4ed78b7c914e8f6773de551207f17a6dc695db99e81cf6674",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
