      "en": "Both chariots and horsemen went up with him. It was a very great company.",
      "ko": "병거와 기병이 요셉을 따라 올라가니 그 떼가 심히 컸더라",
      "source_text_hash": "43b2e896e10e0a40fd40139386392eb47d5b05fb2cab10b51d5c32ee2c38572f",
      "translation_text_hash": "909eca0f3421b0dd7b29ebe5e8f191657685a3b873d03876c50078cd81544311",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "병거와 기병이 요셉을 따라 올라가니 그 떼가 심히 컸더라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "909eca0f3421b0dd7b29ebe5e8f191657685a3b873d03876c50078cd81544311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:GEN:50:10",
      "sequence": 1517,
