      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "GEN",
          "chapter": 50,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "His sons did to him just as he commanded them,",
      "ko": "야곱의 아들들이 부명을 좇아 행하여",
      "source_text_hash": "f16d5bf59d100316c9d1cda6664f33c8166dee5cba5f2e1e476fd48e3ef54a91",
      "translation_text_hash": "dccdc64f6e24b32443c50ba00971c5525f41601de010f300231e0c45f1acf266",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "야곱의 아들들이 부명을 좇아 행하여"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "dccdc64f6e24b32443c50ba00971c5525f41601de010f300231e0c45f1acf266"
      ]
    },
